      </li>
      <li>
      Optional: Set the <code>spec.consolePlugin.register</code> field to <code>true</code> by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc -n netobserv edit flowcollector cluster -o yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: flows.netobserv.io/v1alpha1\nkind: FlowCollector\nmetadata:\n  name: cluster\nspec:\n  consolePlugin:\n    register: true"} lang="text" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
